{"id":"ova30bxjetuoqajtuitzgal8l","title":"研究生与AI大模型的伴生与共生","originalTitle":null,"summary":"大多数研究生目前使用AI大模型的方式是伴生关系，即利用大模型提高效率但不改变研究结构。共生关系则要求双方在研究过程中相互影响，产生新的知识形态。当前的培养体系和评价标准限制了共生关系的实现，但通过刻意设计任务和记录协作过程，研究生可以逐步过渡到共生模式。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=43347&do=blog&id=1560708"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T03:52:21.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T09:58:23.800Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T09:58:23.800Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","DeepMind"],"score":40,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"381fa53a-feaf-4700-982a-292f0846a28c","title":"研究生与AI大模型伴生关系及共生模式实践瓶颈"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"381fa53a-feaf-4700-982a-292f0846a28c","title":"研究生与AI大模型伴生关系及共生模式实践瓶颈"}],"topics":[{"slug":"deepmind","name":"DeepMind"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"faHE_tt76cRE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}